797	    ///
798	    /// The patch is walked like every other one (`patch.rs`'s
799	    /// `check_end_patch`): an unknown key, a value of the wrong JSON kind
800	    /// and a misspelt variant are each refused, naming the dotted path with
801	    /// the group's name in it and the value sent. What it does NOT do is
802	    /// range-check — the state a clip interpolates toward may legitimately
803	    /// name a value no stored group could hold, and `actions_clamp.rs`'s
804	    /// `clamp_video`, `clamp_audio` and `clamp_text` bound the evaluated
