806	    /// checked against the op's `schema` (G-34 (c)).
807	    ///
808	    /// A `null` is the one value the walk lets past at any depth, because
809	    /// here it is a REMOVAL rather than a clear.
810	    ///
811	    /// The refusal that is about this op rather than about the vocabulary:
812	    /// a `video` object naming `motion` is an `Err`. A preset is anchored to
813	    /// the clip's two ends and an action is a ramp between two states, so
814	    /// there is nothing to interpolate — half a slide into half a spin is
